<% content_for(:page_title, "Privacy Policy | Global Synergy") %>

<section class="privacy-page">
  <div class="privacy-container">

    <header class="privacy-header">
      <span class="section-label">
        <span class="section-label-line"></span>
        PRIVACY POLICY
      </span>

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how Global Synergy collects,
        uses and protects information submitted through our website.
      </p>
    </header>


    <div class="privacy-content">

      <section>
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide
          through our website forms, including your name, email address,
          phone number, company information and messages or inquiries submitted to us.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          We may use the information you provide to respond to inquiries,
          provide information about our products and services, communicate
          with customers and business partners, and improve our website and services.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Newsletter</h2>
        <p>
          If you subscribe to our newsletter, we may use your email address
          to send market updates, product information, industry news and
          other relevant communications.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Website Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect
          our website and information submitted through our forms from
          unauthorized access, abuse and automated spam.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>

        <p>
          We use Cloudflare Turnstile to help protect our website forms
          from spam, automated submissions and other forms of abuse.
        </p>

        <p>
          Turnstile may process limited technical information required
          to determine whether a request is legitimate.
          This service is provided by Cloudflare, Inc.
        </p>

        <p>
          For more information, please review
          <a
            href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Cloudflare's Turnstile Privacy Addendum
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Data Retention</h2>

        <p>
          We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably
          necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, including
          responding to inquiries, maintaining business communications and
          complying with applicable legal obligations.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>
          Our website may use third-party services that process limited
          technical information necessary to provide security, hosting
          or other website functionality.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Your Choices</h2>

        <p>
          You may contact us if you would like to request information
          about personal information you submitted through our website
          or request that we update or remove such information where applicable.
        </p>
      </section>


      <section>
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy,
          please contact Global Synergy through our Contact page.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>